# MindMirror does not require any environment variables to run locally —
# it is a pure client-side React + Firebase app with no server-side API calls.
#
# Firebase web configuration lives in `firebase-applet-config.json` at the
# project root. Those values (apiKey, authDomain, projectId, ...) are public
# client identifiers, not secrets — see the "Firebase Configuration" section
# of the README for details.
#
# If you want to point this app at your OWN Firebase project instead of
# editing firebase-applet-config.json directly, you can optionally wire up
# environment-based config yourself; this file is kept as a placeholder for
# that workflow and is not read by the app as-is.
